The AVC WebAssembly decoder under vendor/hibernia is generated from Hibernia
by Eugene Zemtsov (MIT), at revision
0687cce7095998862d53b526ad2c41da43b90add. Its plane-copy accessors were added
to the WebAssembly binding. The license is retained in vendor/hibernia/LICENSE.
Decoder syntax/scaling were checked against ITU-T H.265 (01/2026);
HDR transfer functions against ITU-R BT.2100-3 (02/2025), and
Apple's published "Applying Apple HDR effect to your photos" procedure.
No libheif/libde265/GPL/LGPL codec code or binaries are included.
